New Player Guide:
⚠️ DO NOT MAKE A SEASON CHARACTER
⚠️ SOME CODEX ENTRIES MAY NOT EXIST YET
⚠️ SOME CODEX ENTRIES MAY HAVE INCORRECT ITEM ICONS

- You don't need to follow the normal retail progression route.

- Part One Spawning in for the first time [OH GOD THIS IS A LOT TO TAKE IN ALL AT ONCE](https://www.realclipart.com/middle/m2i8b1i8H7i8G6N4_monkax/)
    - Speak to the Black Spirit
   
    - Complete the Instant Level 49 Quest
   
    - Start the [[To Level 50!] Go Beyond Your Own Limits](https://bdocodex.com/us/quest/21100/7/)
        - Use the [Clear Memory Piece](https://bdocodex.com/us/item/40650/) to complete [[To Level 50!] Go Beyond Your Own Limits](https://bdocodex.com/us/quest/21100/7/)
        - ⚠️ IF YOU DO NOT USE THE [Clear Memory Piece](https://bdocodex.com/us/item/40650/) YOU CANNOT LEVEL BEYOND LEVEL 49! ⚠️
    
    - Complete the Exodus Beginner Rewards Quest
        - This quest gives you a full set of PEN Shadowsoul Armor + Weapons + Accesories
        - Shadowsoul is the basic starting gear
    
    - Equip the Full set of Shadowsoul gear
   
    - Open the Challenges reward menue
    - Press Y (Default keybind)
        - Claim Exodus Pearl Starter
        - Claim Exodus Pet Starter
        - Claim Exodus Premium, Horse, Fairy Reward
            - You may claim everything however the other items claimed maybe outside this guides scope.
        - Activate all the free pets so you can have auto looting
        - Activate your free fairy

    - Open the Pearl shop
    - Press F3 (Default keybind)
    - You have 100,000 free pearls - You can get more by killing monsters + Life skilling 
        - In the pearl shop navigate to:
            - Beauty Tab -> Gifts/Coupons 
                - Buy Morrie's Holiday Gift!
                - Buy Exodus Heidel Ball Gift!
            - Exodus' Pearl Shop Tab
                - Buy Naphart Camp Site
                - Buy Secret Book of Old Moon (15 Days)
                - Buy Value Pack (30 Days)
            - Travel Aid Tab
                - Buy 1 Ornette's Dark Honey Wine (only 1 is needed to max level your fairy)
                - Buy 20-40 Theiah's Orb (To reroll Fairy Skills later)
                - Buy 5 Transaction Maid Fairy's (More when you have more pearls)
                - Buy 5 Storage Maid Fairy's (More when you have more pearls)
                - Buy 5 Item Collection Increase Scroll
            - Close the Pearl Shop 
    
    - Open your inventory
        - Use Secret Book of Old Moon (15 Days)
        - Buy Value Pack (30 Days)
        - Use the Camping Tool
        - Use all the Naphart Camping items (Tent,, Anvil, Shop, Container)

    - Open the Fairy Interface  ! ⚠️ DO NOT CLICK "REBIRTH" BUTTON ⚠️ !
    - Click "Growth" button
        - Use the Ornette's Dark Honey Wine (This will level your fairy to Max level)
    - Click "Change Skill" button
        - In this new interface
            - Select a skill you do not want and click "Change Skill" button
            - repete this until you have "Miraculous Cheer V"
                - The other skills are up to you
                    - Suggest: "Feathery Steps V"
                    - Suggest: "Tingling Breath V"

    - Run towards the [Western Guard Camp](https://bdocodex.com/us/node/2/)
    - Kill the Imps surrounding the [Western Guard Camp](https://bdocodex.com/us/node/2/) until you reach level 63

    - Open the Black Spirit
    - Complete your classes Awakening Quests (Just talking to the Black Spirit a lot)
    - Complete your classes Succesion Quests (Just talking to the Black Spirit a lot)
        - You will have a quest item in your inventory after you complete both quest lines, You can delete it.

    - Equip your awakening weapon

    - Open your Skills window K (Default keybind)
        - Select your perfered playstyle Succesion or Awakening
        - Put skill points in everything you want to - you should have plenty of points



- Important New player Tips
    - There are teleports all over the game in the Pearl Shop - These teleports are FREE
        - If you have Exodus Premium you do gain access to additional teleport locations AND aditional outfit selections
    - World bosses are a very good idea to do when you can, they provide great materials for progressing
    - There is a [World Boss Event](https://discord.com/channels/1285178546561613842/1311399523423223848) every week All world bosses spawn and you can get a lot of powerful materials
    - There is a Special Boss Spawn [Acnologia](https://discord.com/channels/1285178546561613842/1537499635759976498) 5 times a week and you can get the best alchemy stones from it along with extremely powerful crystals
    - All monster kills have a chance of droping a [Pearl Box - 200](https://exodusbdcodex.pages.dev/#/item/pearl-box-200)
        - When you have a lot of these boxes you can exchange them with Marni for a larger box up to [Pearl Box 100K](https://exodusbdcodex.pages.dev/#/item/pearl-box-100k)
            - Opening too many [Pearl Box - 200](https://exodusbdcodex.pages.dev/#/item/pearl-box-200) can cause a lot of lag and potentially crash your client
    
    - Located [across from Tranan Underfoe](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/300900135725039616/1560467856469008544/image.png?ex=6ad2d271&is=6ad180f1&hm=efa13f39faa9d97b465f9f0c2c822c9614a12c46ed782c9e71a139d0038aa091&) a blacksmith with patience you can find special NPCs
